A floating component (like a menu) is positioned relative to its ownerCt if any.
Useful for popping up a context menu:

    listeners: {
        itemcontextmenu: function(view, record, item, index, event, options) {
            Ext.create('Ext.menu.Menu', {
                width: 100,
                height: 100,
                margin: '0 0 10 0',
                items: [{
                    text: 'regular item 1'
                },{
                    text: 'regular item 2'
                },{
                    text: 'regular item 3'
                }]
